    "body": "### Motivation\n\nMake the product header in Compare mode more compact by combining brand, quantity, and name into a tighter layout to save vertical space.\n\n### Proposed solution\n\nRefactor the header layout to present brand/quantity and product name together in a compact format (single line or tighter two-line layout), ensuring readability on small screens.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Header uses less vertical space while remaining readable.\n- [ ] Responsive behavior preserved on small screens.\n- [ ] No information lost in the compacted layout.\n\n### Design / mockup\n\n_No response_\n\n### Alternatives considered\n\n_No response_\n\n### Additional context\n\nParent: #1557",
